  "content": "\n\n# 擴充三叉戟附魔\n\n**此數據包與模組**將武器附魔擴展至三叉戟，使其可使用火焰附加、擊退、抢夺、穿刺、密度、破甲與風暴衝刺。同時允許您在同一把三叉戟上混搭不同類型的武器附魔！\n\n**‎◾範例：**\n\n![Expanded Trident Enchantings](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c52f1a0ac7ffd152c4f25ed7701ce3061d8e992.jpeg)\n\n![Expanded Trident Enchantings](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f885bc7c037174546d7ccd3144bee3f78e2c90de.jpeg)\n\n\n\n## 詳細資訊📝\n\n- **擴充三叉戟附魔**與版本 **1.21 至 1.21.11** **相容**\n- **擴充三叉戟附魔**為附魔台新增**（擴展內容）**🌐\n- **擴充三叉戟附魔**與任何**附魔數據包**均相容\n- **無**需**解壓縮**下載的檔案 🗂️\n\n## 更多專案：\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-armor-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TM5K3dNM/ezgif-com-speed-43.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (43)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/expanded-weapon-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bML9W70B/ezgif-com-speed-44.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (44)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-trident-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VcwSJqRJ/Expanded-Trident-Enchants-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Trident Enchants Logo\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-mace-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXv2pS15/Expanded-Mace-Enchants-Logo-2.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Mace Enchants Logo (2)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-axe-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Fqxsn0qL/ezgif-com-speed-47.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (47)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-bow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWLkm7bC/ezgif-com-speed-48.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (48)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-crossbow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PzT0xXgD/ezgif-com-speed-49.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (49)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-spear-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJBJp9c/ezgif-com-resize-1.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com resize (1)\" border=\"0\"></a>",
